---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---
<AdminLayout title="Wallet walkthrough">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
        <div><p class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Issue · present · check status</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Wallet walkthrough</h2><p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Follow a real request through your source, this gateway, a wallet and the verifier.</p></div>
        <a href="/console/dashboard" class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-500">← Gateway overview</a>
    </div>
    <section class="flow-card mb-6" aria-label="Current environment">
        <p id="flow-runtime" class="font-semibold" role="status">Checking the current environment…</p>
        <p id="flow-runtime-detail" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">Only explicit actions below create offers or presentation requests.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">A successful request here is runtime evidence. Independent Android, iOS or miTch acceptance also needs a pinned wallet build, agreed trust/schema/status configuration and public HTTPS evidence.</p>
        <details class="mt-4"><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer">How to test with a live wallet</summary><ol class="list-decimal pl-5 text-sm text-slate-500 space-y-2 mt-3"><li>Use a dedicated test holder. Confirm the wallet can reach the issuer URL below; a phone cannot reach this computer through its own localhost.</li><li>For EUDI, use the agreed Android reference build with issuer and verifier trust registration, the custom VeriCred schema and required encryption. Custom mode is a separate integration profile.</li><li>Create an offer, scan it in the wallet and accept issuance. Confirm a new credential record appears below.</li><li>Create a presentation request for the same type. Scan it, inspect the requested claims and consent in the wallet. Review only the disclosed fields in the result.</li><li>Inspect the issued record and revoke this test credential. Create a new presentation request. A rejected response or wallet refusal needs its own observed evidence; a pending request alone proves neither.</li></ol></details>
    </section>

    <div class="grid xl:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
        <section id="issue" class="flow-card" aria-labelledby="issue-heading">
            <div class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3 id="issue-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Issue to a wallet</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">The holder lookup and schema mapping happen when you create the offer.</p></div></div>
            <form id="offer-form" class="mt-5 space-y-4">
                <div><label for="select-holder">Select holder</label><select id="select-holder"><option value="">Loading holders…</option></select><p id="holder-source-note" class="field-note">Holder details follow the gateway’s privacy settings.</p></div>
                <div><label for="input-holder-identifier">Or enter a source identifier</label><input id="input-holder-identifier" type="text" maxlength="500" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Identifier used by your data source" /><p class="field-note">Use a known identifier if your connector does not support listing.</p></div>
                <div><label for="select-template">Credential type</label><select id="select-template" required><option value="">Loading types…</option></select></div>
                <details><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer">See the source mapping and requested claims</summary><div id="mapping-summary" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3">Choose a credential type.</div></details>
                <button id="create-offer" class="primary-action w-full" type="submit" disabled>Create credential offer</button>
            </form>
            <p id="offer-status" class="flow-status" role="status">No offer created.</p>
            <div id="offer-qr" class="qr-stage" hidden></div>
            <div id="offer-actions" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3" hidden><button id="copy-offer" class="secondary-action" type="button">Copy offer link</button><a id="open-offer" class="secondary-action" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">Open wallet</a><button id="hide-offer" class="secondary-action" type="button">Hide offer</button></div>
            <p class="field-note mt-3">The QR contains a one-use grant. Share it only with the intended holder. Hiding it does not revoke an already shared offer.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="present" class="flow-card" aria-labelledby="present-heading">
            <div class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3 id="present-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Request a presentation</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">After issuance, ask the wallet to disclose the selected claims.</p></div></div>
            <form id="presentation-form" class="mt-5 space-y-4"><div><label for="presentation-type">Credential type to verify</label><select id="presentation-type" required><option value="">Loading types…</option></select></div><p id="requested-claims" class="text-sm text-slate-500">Choose a credential type.</p><button id="create-presentation" class="primary-action w-full" type="submit" disabled>Create presentation request</button></form>
            <p id="presentation-status" class="flow-status" role="status">No presentation request created.</p>
            <div id="presentation-qr" class="qr-stage" hidden></div>
            <div id="presentation-actions" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3" hidden><button id="copy-presentation" class="secondary-action" type="button">Copy request link</button><a id="open-presentation" class="secondary-action" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">Open wallet</a><button id="stop-presentation" class="secondary-action" type="button">Stop waiting</button></div>
            <div id="presentation-result" class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 p-4" hidden><h4 class="font-semibold text-emerald-500">Presentation verified</h4><p id="verified-at" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1"></p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">Signature, holder binding, requested type, nonce, audience and local credential status passed at verification time.</p><label class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3 text-sm"><input id="show-claim-values" type="checkbox" /> Show disclosed values on this screen</label><dl id="verified-claims" class="mt-3 space-y-2"></dl><p id="extra-claims" class="field-note"></p></div>
            <p class="field-note mt-3">This verifier accepts credentials issued by this gateway. A previous successful result is historical; create a new request after revocation.</p>
        </section>
    </div>

    <section id="records" class="flow-card mb-6" aria-labelledby="records-heading">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex gap-3 items-center"><span class="step-number">3</span><h3 id="records-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Inspect issuance and revocation</h3></div><button id="refresh-records" class="secondary-action" type="button">Refresh records</button></div>
        <p id="records-status" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4" role="status">Loading credential records…</p>
        <div class="mb-4"><label for="record-filter">Filter records</label><input id="record-filter" type="search" placeholder="Type, masked subject or credential ID" /></div>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-500"><th scope="col" class="p-3">Issued</th><th scope="col" class="p-3">Subject</th><th scope="col" class="p-3">Type</th><th scope="col" class="p-3">Recorded status</th><th scope="col" class="p-3">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="credentials-tbody"><tr><td colspan="5" class="p-4">Loading…</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        <div id="record-detail" class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 mt-5" hidden><h4 class="font-semibold mb-3">Selected credential</h4><dl id="record-fields" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm"></dl><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4"><button id="check-status" class="secondary-action" type="button">Check status endpoint</button><button id="revoke-record" class="danger-action" type="button">Revoke this credential</button></div><p id="record-action-status" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3" role="status"></p><p class="field-note mt-3">Revocation is permanent. The next valid presentation must be refused. Public wallet status refresh can depend on its cache policy.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="flow-card" aria-labelledby="alerts-heading"><div class="flex justify-between gap-3 items-center"><h3 id="alerts-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Recent protocol alerts</h3><button id="refresh-alerts" class="secondary-action" type="button">Refresh alerts</button></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">These issuance alerts support diagnosis. The absence of an alert does not prove wallet success or rejection.</p><ul id="protocol-alerts" class="space-y-3 mt-4"><li class="text-sm text-slate-500">Loading alerts…</li></ul></section>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-5">Reloading clears this page’s offer links, presentation read token and displayed results. It does not delete issued credentials or cancel already shared requests.</p>

    <script>
        import '../../wallet-walkthrough';
    </script>
    <style>
        .flow-card {padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:1rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);scroll-margin-top:6rem;}
        .step-number {display:inline-flex;flex-shrink:0;background:#d1fae5;color:#047857;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;}
        label {display:block;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem;}select,input:not([type="checkbox"]) {display:block;width:100%;padding:.7rem .85rem;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:.65rem;background:#fff;color:#0f172a;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;}input[type="checkbox"] {accent-color:#047857;width:1rem;height:1rem;}
        .primary-action,.secondary-action,.danger-action {display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.7rem 1rem;border-radius:.75rem;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;cursor:pointer;}.primary-action {background:#047857;color:#fff;}.secondary-action {border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#334155;background:white;}.danger-action {border:1px solid #fecaca;color:#b91c1c;background:#fef2f2;}button:disabled {opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;}
        .field-note {font-size:.75rem;color:#64748b;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.4rem;}.flow-status {font-size:.85rem;color:#475569;margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.6;}.qr-stage {display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:.75rem;padding:1rem;margin-top:1rem;min-height:240px;}.qr-stage :global(img) {width:256px;max-width:100%;height:auto;image-rendering:pixelated;}
        [hidden] {display:none!important;}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible {outline:3px solid #10b981;outline-offset:3px;}table button {text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;}
    </style>
</AdminLayout>
